                "text": "In 1992, Congress passed the Veterans Healthcare Act, which specifically prohibited VA from providing abortions in most circumstances. Today, the administration reversed a Biden-era expansion of abortion services at the department to return to following the 1992 law &, in doing so, protect the unborn.",
